{"content":[{"c":["HANAN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":[" 1. Shashak’s son and one of the chief men of Benjamin (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.23","r":"1Chr.8.23","rawR":"1Chr.8.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.23","value":"1Chr.8.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 2. Azel’s son from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.38","r":"1Chr.8.38","rawR":"1Chr.8.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.38","value":"1Chr.8.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:38"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.44","r":"1Chr.9.44","rawR":"1Chr.9.44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.44","value":"1Chr.9.44"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:44"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 3. Warrior among David’s mighty men, who were known as “the thirty” (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.43","r":"1Chr.11.43","rawR":"1Chr.11.43","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.43","value":"1Chr.11.43"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:43"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 4. Ancestor of a group of temple assistants who returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.46","r":"Ezra.2.46","rawR":"Ezra.2.46","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.46","value":"Ezra.2.46"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:46"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.49","r":"Neh.7.49","rawR":"Neh.7.49","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.49","value":"Neh.7.49"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:49"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 5. Levitical assistant who explained to the people passages from the law read by Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.7","r":"Neh.8.7","rawR":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.7","value":"Neh.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6. Levite who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.10","r":"Neh.10.10","rawR":"Neh.10.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.10","value":"Neh.10.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 7, 8. Two political leaders who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.22,26","r":"Neh.10.22,26","rawR":"Neh.10.22,26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.22,26","value":"Neh.10.22,26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:22, 26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 9. One of the Levites whom Nehemiah appointed as treasurer over the storehouses (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.13.13","r":"Neh.13.13","rawR":"Neh.13.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.13.13","value":"Neh.13.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 13:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. Igdaliah’s son and head of a prophetic guild occupying the room in the temple where Jeremiah offered the Rechabites wine to drink (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.35.4","r":"Jer.35.4","rawR":"Jer.35.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.35.4","value":"Jer.35.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 35:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hanan","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.38","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.38","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.38"},{"anchorText":"9:44","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.44","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.44","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.44"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:43","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.43","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.43","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.43"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:46","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.46","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.46","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.46"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:49","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream